WEBVTT

00:09:29.089 --> 00:09:31.568
so nobody knew what the heck
was wrong with me.

00:09:31.592 --> 00:09:33.619
(Laughter)

00:09:33.643 --> 00:09:37.609
I would soon find out that there was
a high price to pay for my freedom

00:09:37.633 --> 00:09:39.634
and for questioning the patriarchy.

00:09:39.658 --> 00:09:41.251
But I was happy to pay it,

00:09:41.275 --> 00:09:43.507
because for every blow that I received,

00:09:43.531 --> 00:09:45.340
I was able to deliver two.

00:09:45.364 --> 00:09:46.514
(Laughter)

00:09:46.943 --> 00:09:49.902
Once, when my daughter Paula
was in her twenties,

00:09:49.926 --> 00:09:53.680
she said to me that feminism was dated,
that I should move on.

00:09:54.315 --> 00:09:56.166
We had a memorable fight.

00:09:56.643 --> 00:09:58.547
Feminism is dated?

00:09:58.571 --> 00:10:03.228
Yes, for privileged women
like my daughter and all of us here today,